@startuml
title Fluxo de Pesquisa e Detalhes (Doctors Service)
autonumber

actor Patient as "Paciente / Frontend"
participant DocCtrl as "PhysicianController"
database Mongo as "MongoDB"

box "Doctors Service" #LightBlue
    participant DocCtrl
    participant Mongo
end box

== Cenário A: Pesquisa (Search) ==

Patient -> DocCtrl: GET /physicians/search?query=Cardio
activate DocCtrl

    note right of Patient: Requer Role: PATIENT

    DocCtrl -> Mongo: findByNameOrSpecialty("Cardio")
    activate Mongo
    Mongo --> DocCtrl: List<Physician> (Entities)
    deactivate Mongo

    DocCtrl -> DocCtrl: Converter Entity -> PhysicianResponse (DTO)
    note right: Remove dados sensíveis (se houver)

    DocCtrl --> Patient: JSON [ {id: 2, name: "Dr. House", ...} ]

deactivate DocCtrl

== Cenário B: Obter Detalhes (Get By ID) ==

Patient -> DocCtrl: GET /physicians/{id}
activate DocCtrl

    DocCtrl -> Mongo: findById(id)
    activate Mongo
    Mongo --> DocCtrl: Optional<Physician>
    deactivate Mongo

    alt Physician Not Found
        DocCtrl --> Patient: 404 Not Found
    else Found
        alt Header X-INTERNAL-KEY presente?
            DocCtrl --> Patient: Retorna Entidade Completa (JSON)
            note right: Uso interno entre microsserviços
        else Acesso Externo (Patient/Admin)
            DocCtrl -> DocCtrl: Map to PhysicianResponse (DTO)
            DocCtrl --> Patient: Retorna DTO Limitado
        end
    end

deactivate DocCtrl
@enduml